  "bodyHash": "417d95e0896b96d6",
  "content": "\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">简介</span></h3>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1419951/description_3d16c543-ce85-4c52-8fcc-bdd7a19992a3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"441\" height=\"120\"></span></h2>\n<h5><strong>Rice</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Delight&nbsp;</strong>是《<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a>》的附属模组，不仅为米饭带来了全新风味与更多独特性，还为你的游戏添加了新作物。</h5>\n<h5>&nbsp;</h5>\n<h5>享受一些美味的菜肴，通过种植<strong>甜椒&nbsp;</strong>或<strong>罗勒</strong>等新作物来扩展你的农场。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1419951/description_ad7dc5b9-2fa2-4d6c-a58b-8c0c69ac5bcf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"721\" height=\"413\"></p>\n<h5>深入探索<strong>墨西哥卷饼</strong>&nbsp;或<strong>家常美食</strong>的世界，这些你可能在你的<strong>童年</strong>中有所熟悉。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1419951/description_d7abfc78-81a3-4373-b891-02a5adfc7841.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"717\" height=\"406\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1419951/description_34edd519-a656-403d-9c18-37dd7f4a45d3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"714\" height=\"393\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h4><strong>🔨 模组加载器<br></strong></h4>\n<h5>Rice Delight 是一款<strong>Forge</strong>模组。目前暂无<strong>Fabric</strong>移植版，也暂无相关计划。</h5>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
